  "name": null,
  "problem": "In Oslo, Norway, the average temperature in November is ${3.3}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ In January, the average temperature decreases by ${6.2}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}$ compared to November. Finally, in March, the average temperature increases by ${4.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}$ compared to January. Determine the average temperature in Oslo in March.",
